/files/Venom.png?v=1753182756\"\n              alt=\"Nitrix 70 Venom badminton racket\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n              width=\"900\"\n              height=\"900\"\n            >\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__card-body\">\n            <h3>Nitrix 70 Venom</h3>\n            <h4>Violence, refined.</h4>\n            <p>\n              Head-heavy pressure with a razor-thin 6.1mm shaft. Built for players who finish rallies before they get comfortable.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__specs\">\n            <span>32 LBS</span>\n            <span>6.1MM</span>\n            <span>ATTACK</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <a href=\"/products/nitrix-70-venom\" class=\"hn-member-access__cta\">\n            Enter Venom\n            <span>→</span>\n          </a>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- VOLTA - BLUE -->\n        <article\n          class=\"hn-member-access__card\"\n          style=\"--accent:#1f7ed8; --accent-rgb:31,126,216; --card-show:var(--card-2);\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__card-top\">\n            <p>Power Access</p>\n            <span>02</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__media\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0933/9378/1029/files/Volta.png?v=1753182756\"\n              alt=\"Nitrix 70 Volta badminton racket\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n              width=\"900\"\n              height=\"900\"\n            >\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__card-body\">\n            <h3>Nitrix 70 Volta</h3>\n            <h4>Power with a cleaner cut.</h4>\n            <p>\n              Fast frame response, hard contact, and enough bite to turn half chances into winners.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hn-member-access__specs\">\n            <span>32 LBS</span>\n            <span>7.0MM</span>\n            <span>POWER</s